    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143540/extras/4c37c6e9836fa52fda4b44ce806372f1.avif?t=1750738196\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single ending with 1+ hours until credits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple one-click gameplay for all player actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various part-time gigs from konbini clerk to sento staff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock up on energy drinks to boost work performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overworked? Take a break and discover the town </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming, slice-of-life indie RPG where you earn some sweet cash by trying out various part-time jobs\u2014all in the name of getting your girl the perfect gift! But just when you think you\u2019ve got it all figured out, life throws you an unexpected twist...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143540/extras/cefdc9336cd5bde67d9f775da7731c4c.avif?t=1750738196\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nenena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine of this story. A candid girl who doesn't like to overthink things.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143540/extras/4c37c6e9836fa52fda4b44ce806372f1.avif?t=1750738196\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single ending with 1+ hours until credits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple one-click gameplay for all player actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various part-time gigs from konbini clerk to sento staff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock up on energy drinks to boost work performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overworked? Take a break and discover the town </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming, slice-of-life indie RPG where you earn some sweet cash by trying out various part-time jobs\u2014all in the name of getting your girl the perfect gift! But just when you think you\u2019ve got it all figured out, life throws you an unexpected twist...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143540/extras/cefdc9336cd5bde67d9f775da7731c4c.avif?t=1750738196\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nenena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine of this story. A candid girl who doesn't like to overthink things.</p>",
